### 2. Test Login - Failure (Invalid Credentials)
# Logic: Should return a 401 Unauthorized status
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wrongUser",
  "password": "wrongPassword"
}

